      398.77,
      539.95,
      493.84
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Lakshman Kiriella,Minister of Higher Education and Highways, on the recommendation of the University Grants Commission, do by thisOrder, amend the Schedule to the Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1482/26 of February 02, 2007 establishingthe University of Peradeniya, Sri Lanka which Order is deemed, by virtue of the provisions of Section 139 of the aforesaid,Act, to be an Order made under Section 21 of the said Act, (as last amended by Order published in Gazette ExtraordinaryNo. 1990/16 of October 26, 2016), by the substitution for the entry \u201c8. Department of Production Engineering\u201d appearingin Column II of the Schedule which corresponds to the item \u201cFaculty of Engineering\u201d in Column I of the Schedule of thefollowing entry :-",
